{
  "format": "ta-scenario/1",
  "description": "Gate A's pose inventory: 68 units across four clusters, each cluster its own camera stop, so `tagpu_posewatch.on`'s errmax can be read per group rather than over the whole map. Cluster 1 at (2100,1200) is ground -- ARM and CORE kbots, tanks and both commanders, all on hold at facings that are not multiples of 90. Cluster 2 at (3100,1200) is structures, including the animated ones (WIN's rotor, RAD's dish). Cluster 3 at (4000,1200) is the extremes the geometry bake has to hold: ARMSCORP and CORSCORP are the 36-piece models, the most pieces in stock content, and CORGANT is the most vertices and faces (574/304). Cluster 4 at (2600,2000) is the air lane, on a tight patrol so fighters, gunships, bombers and transports stay over one stop. EVERYTHING is owned by player 0 so that nothing shoots anything and the poses are the only thing moving; player 1 holds one distant solar collector because a player with no units at all ends the game.",
